@startmindmap

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam Shadowing false

<style>
mindmapDiagram {
  node {
    FontName Consolas
    FontSize 14
  }

  .archive {
    BackgroundColor #PeachPuff
    LineColor #c7b300
  }

  .folder {
    BackgroundColor #FFF8E7
    LineColor #D6A100
  }

  .file {
    BackgroundColor white
    LineColor #808080
  }
}
</style>

* 📦  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-archive-portabilite Archive de portabilité]] <<archive>>
** 📄  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-manifest MANIFEST.XML]] (1..1) <<file>>
** 📄  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-readme README.TXT]] (1..1) <<file>>
** 📄  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-signature SIGN.XML]] (1..1) <<file>>

** 📁 Documentation d'export (1..1) <<folder>>
*** 📄 Document (1..*) <<file>>

** 📦  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-archive-transverse Archive de données transverses]] (1..1) <<archive>>
*** 📄  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-readme README.TXT]] (1..1) <<file>>
*** 📁 TRANSVERSE (1..1) <<folder>>
**** 📄 Document transverse [[sf-perimetre-pivot.html Périmètre pivot]] (1..*) <<file>>
**** 📄 Document transverse hors périmètre pivot (0..*) <<file>>

** 📦  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-archive-patient Archive XDM patient]] (1..*) <<archive>>
*** 📄  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-readme README.TXT]] (1..1) <<file>>
*** 📄  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-index INDEX.HTM]] (1..1) <<file>>
*** 📁 PDF (1..1) <<folder>>
**** 📄 Document PDF (1..*) <<file>>
*** 📁 IHE_XDM (1..1) <<folder>>
**** 📁 Lot de soumission (1..1) <<folder>>
***** 📄  [[StructureDefinition-pdlgc-metadata METADATA.XML]] (1..1) <<file>>
***** 📄 Document patient [[sf-perimetre-pivot.html Périmètre pivot]] (1..*) <<file>>
***** 📄 Document patient hors périmètre pivot (0..*) <<file>>

@endmindmap